WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.760
Karala's elder sister, Harulu Ajiba,

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.490
saw the Ideon with her own eyes for the first time.

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:43.080
She might have been even more surprised
than her underling, Guhaba Geba.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:49.800
She wants the mysterious power
of the Ide more than anyone else.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:02.680
<b>Breaking Through the Enemy Front</b>

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:12.900
Sanra!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:17.650
If you succeed in this spy mission, the rank of Sabia is yours without a doubt.

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:21.390
We need time to complete the repairs on the Zigg Mack.

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:24.940
Create unrest among the enemy to bring their guard down.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.070
Roger.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.930
Don't forget the anti-air surveillance!

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:32.750
Yes sir!

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:55.420
Good morning.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.740
Ah, good morning.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.190
I made what you call "coffee".

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:01.340
You were able to do it?

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.410
As a samurai's daughter, I was well educated.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:07.420
I've been taught all sorts of things.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.160
I wonder if you like it?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.690
Ah, thanks.

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.420
Is there something wrong?

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.960
No, it tastes good.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:23.900
It's a little strong, and a bit too sweet, but...

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.430
It's great.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:31.390
I'm thinking about meeting with my sister.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:32.970
Your sister?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:34.350
Her name was Harulu, right?

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:38.600
I'm going to ask her to stop attacking this ship.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.820
Is she really going to just let us go?

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:43.810
My sister does have an interest in the Ide...

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:45.370
Is there still some coffee left?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.410
It's a bit too sweet, is that okay?

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.390
Yeah, it's fine.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:50.620
Karala.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.050
I'll give some thought to what you just said.

00:03:54.050 --> 00:03:55.300
Please hurry.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:56.460
Okay.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.420
Yo.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.060
You're up early.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.580
Have you adjusted the computer key?

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:08.710
For the most part.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.370
She's just looking for an excuse to escape.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.370
I make the decisions.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:25.820
Kids have no say in this.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.300
Just who do you think you are?

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.640
You're way too soft on women for a soldier.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.570
You let Karala do what she wants.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.200
I'm not treating her soft because she's a woman!

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.360
She's one of the Buff Clan, understand?!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.300
Damn you!

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.660
I'm a soldier.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.150
I don't make decisions based only on emotions, unlike you!

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.100
Shut your mouth!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:53.070
But this is all the Buff Clan's fault!

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:54.520
She's a Buff Clan woman!

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.730
Damnit!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.570
Prove me you mean it.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:19.680
The air here is so warm, there doesn't seem to be any water.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:24.760
The normal engine should be capable of outputting more power than this.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:28.010
Well, maybe you failed to fix it properly?

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.220
What'd you say?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.970
I spent all night working on it!

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:32.630
Joliver!

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:34.600
This isn't the time for quarreling!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.200
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.130
You see now?

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.000
You're all getting on my nerves!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.160
You're not getting better at all.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.300
But...

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:56.380
You'll never grow up if you can't even use chopsticks...

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:57.420
Enough!

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.690
Lin, give me a knife and fork!

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.990
Using chopsticks is good practice for your fingers,

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:03.710
everyone else is doing it...

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:06.150
But...

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.960
You'll learn it soon enough.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.320
Hey, isn't there any more?

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:10.650
That's all.

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:12.180
Try to bear with it for a while.

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:13.840
Why?

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.980
Isn't there a lot more left over there?

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.850
That's all we have.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.810
Why?

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:23.610
It doesn't look like we'll get restocked,

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.110
so we have to spend them little by little.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:27.580
Oh?

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:28.900
There are civilians here?

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.790
Didn't I tell you not to play with mud?

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.470
But there's nothing to do!

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.910
Aren't we ever going to get away from this planet?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.680
Man, how long until we set off?

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.540
The engine isn't going to explode, right?

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.250
Oh, which one of you started it?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.450
Was it you, Ashura?

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:45.520
Or was it Lou?

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:48.200
Be a good kid, don't cry.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.190
I hate them!

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:51.210
Why?

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.130
Nobody treats me nice.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.970
Lotta and Lin too...

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.830
That's not true.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.950
They're all trying their best.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:02.080
Everyone's feeling anxious.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.110
How is your injury, Damido?

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.120
It's nothing...

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:16.260
But I should have died for my failure.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:19.530
Lady Harulu doesn't care for sentimentality.

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:20.630
But...

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.970
She's supposedly a dignified woman.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.740
What do you mean, dignified?

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.710
She wallows in her own emotions,

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.920
which is why she doesn't care about men's feelings.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:31.680
Huh?

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.550
She's been rejected.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.870
Well, that really broke her heart,

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:39.390
and now she vents her anger out on us men.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:43.500
There was a man in Buff Clan who rejected her?

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.590
Who was that person?

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.600
I don't know that much.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:52.570
Ah, there she is!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.740
Hey, woman!

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:58.970
What do you want?

00:07:58.970 --> 00:07:59.770
Stand!

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:00.830
Stand?

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:03.140
What are you going to do to her?!

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.020
You shouldn't be playing with her.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:06.330
What are you doing?

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.830
Don't play dumb!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.030
Like you don't know!

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:09.980
I don't understand.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.290
We'll make you understand!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.470
Ashura!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.330
Look after Piper Lou.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.760
She's playing with us!

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.100
Why take her away?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.050
I'll return in a moment, Ashura!

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:25.060
Don't joke!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:28.350
Bring Karala back!

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:30.300
Go!

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.700
It was Karala after all?

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:33.960
Of course!

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:34.900
Right...

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.860
They said the Solo Ship's going to be okay...

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:39.300
But the engine's not working, and we don't have any water!

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:41.870
That alien woman! She said the Solo Ship is going to get blown up!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.020
What are we gonna do?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.800
What have I done to you?

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:50.710
You spread rumors about the Solo Ship being in
 danger and try to cause anxiety among the crew.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:54.590
Causing panic among the enemy is a rudimentary tactic.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.930
You're saying I did that?

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.670
Even if everyone says that...

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.450
I trust Karala.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.510
Bes...

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:07.090
This woman has promised to negotiate for us.

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.410
You think she can do it?

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.900
She's already failed once.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:10.850
No!

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.910
This time I'll be meeting my sister.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.860
It's worth at least trying.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.020
Is that so?

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.790
You did it, Sanra...

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:28.330
Now get out!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.510
Look outside!

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.010
Joliver, to the engine room!

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:31.800
Okay!

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:33.770
There's a spy!

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:34.770
What'd you say?

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:39.470
Hey, what's wrong?!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.260
What happened?!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:40.800
Hey!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.400
There's a spy!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.670
Go ahead, shoot!

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:50.610
Don't let him escape!

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:52.520
Over there!

00:09:58.680 --> 00:09:59.690
You won't get away!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.690
Since they've sent spies,

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:13.040
it seems that they're not currently able to attack us.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.280
In that case,

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:17.480
there's no need to draw back unlike Karala said, right?

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.310
We've done with that discussion.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:22.820
I think this conflict is a horrible thing.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:26.340
Even Harulu's side is constantly suffering casualties.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:28.240
If you don't return within the time limit,

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:30.850
we're going to leave this planet without you, get it?

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:31.860
I don't mind.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.760
Repair the engine room as fast as possible.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:35.960
Is this really alright?

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.720
Are you abandoning the Buff Clan?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:00.550
We're getting close!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.360
Guhaba! What's the situation?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.050
Ma'am!

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:23.600
Our spies were able to successfully infiltrate the alien ship.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.120
Well then, please wait here.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:26.930
Karala...

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:27.480
Hide!

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:27.910
Karala!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:33.620
Who's there?!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:35.120
Name yourself!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:37.660
Stop!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.020
Lady Karala?!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:40.470
Lady Karala?!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.460
Karala?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.630
How could she...

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.800
How could she just shamelessly come here?

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:20.070
Sister, you seem to be doing as well as usual.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.950
Do you know how many valuable soldiers we have lost...

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:28.820
because of your thoughtless behavior?

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:30.440
The Buff Clan is at fault.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.230
What?!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.850
They only fight because you keep provoking them.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.150
Lou, don't cry...

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:37.770
I've got to go after all!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.760
I can't leave Bes by himself!

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:41.670
Cosmo!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.840
If you go, the ship will be defenseless!

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.640
You should wait until the engine is fixed.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.030
What if Bes betrays us?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.460
Don't be a fool!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.350
Bes is in love with Karala! You'll never know.

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.620
Let's go, Cosmo!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.040
Make him stop crying!

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.020
But...

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:58.110
Walking around helps to calm him down!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.850
I just need to keep the enemy away from here.

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.120
I'm taking Kasha with me!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.350
You're going to leave the Solo Ship alone?

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.750
Do you get it now?

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.890
The launch shock is huge.

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.520
You can't handle it yet, Deck.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.530
I'll get used to it.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.190
We'll see.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:25.120
If the aliens weren't related to the Ide, we'd leave them alone!

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.070
Guhaba!

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:26.700
Yes?

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.970
I want you to humiliate Karala!

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:30.950
Laugh at her!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:31.940
But Lady Karala...

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.090
I don't care!

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.640
She's sided with the aliens!

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:36.640
Sister...

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.130
There are all these soldiers around...

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.190
Laugh at her, Guhaba.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.960
Then imprison her.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:43.750
Yes, Ma'am!

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:50.220
Could my own sister...

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:50.780
Shut up!

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:52.690
You sold out the Buff Clan!

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:03.900
Sister!

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:05.310
Laugh!

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.110
Soldiers! Laugh at her!

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:11.010
Guhaba!

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:11.980
Laugh!

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:13.310
Aren't you going to laugh?

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.720
Yes ma'am!

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:22.670
Laugh, all of you!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.820
Laugh!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:45.220
Bes?!

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:46.130
An alien!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:47.570
What?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.520
Fire!

00:14:58.510 --> 00:14:59.410
Bes!

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.600
Lady Harulu, please get out of here!

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:03.160
No, wait!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.320
I want to see what that alien man will do.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:10.280
Bes, why?

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.620
Shaming your own sister is a line you shouldn't cross!

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:13.550
Bes!

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:20.430
We Buff Clan follow the code of the samurai.

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:22.050
I shall face you.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.840
What kind of samurai humiliates a woman like that?

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:27.570
Bes.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.290
Guhaba's a master swordsman.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.690
Refuse to fight and we'll shoot you full of holes.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.070
If you win, I'll let you have Karala.

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:37.500
Do you expect me to be grateful?

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:40.630
I'm not a slave.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:43.990
I won't listen to your orders.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:45.410
Let's go, alien!

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:54.010
Bes...

00:15:58.400 --> 00:15:59.570
He's not bad...

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.120
That alien...

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.980
Doesn't look like Bes is here, Cosmo.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.320
I don't see anybody.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.610
He must be contacting the Buff Clan.

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:15.820
Kasha, wait here!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:17.580
We're going to head out a little further!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.330
The Ideo-Delta?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.210
That Cosmo!

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.620
Get Lady Harulu to the Gataman Zan!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.130
Prepare for battle!

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:31.990
Wait!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:32.800
Are you running away?

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:34.840
What are you saying?!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.360
Your allies are shooting us! The duel is off!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.660
Go ahead, shoot him!

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:44.930
Karala!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:45.770
Can you run?

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:46.030
Yes!

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:46.630
Cosmo!

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:48.020
Attack the enemy with the Ideon!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:50.220
Kasha!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:52.060
Lift off the Ideo-Nova with remote control!

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.290
We're docking!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.140
Ideo-Delta!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.200
Turn 90 degrees!

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.350
Bes!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.430
Is Guhaba heading out on the Zigg Mack?

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:33.280
Yes!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.900
The main particle cannon has yet to be repaired, though...

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:37.040
I don't care.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.470
The Gil Baus can act as his support.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:41.090
Tell them to give it a try!

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:41.690
Yes!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.160
The Zurow Jick stays to protect the Gataman Zan.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:51.090
Once the Gil Baus have binded the enemy with hooks, we'll charge in!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.380
Again?

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:00.430
There's one on the right!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.810
Damn you!

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:29.270
Use the Zigg Mack's Claw Attack!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:36.760
They're coming from front!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:41.270
Techno! Can you fire the Glen Cannons?

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:42.760
In front! In front!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:43.930
Kasha! Missiles!

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:03.910
Go!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:12.170
Don't let them break away from the Claw Attack!

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:15.100
Techno!

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:17.050
Fire the front Glen Cannon!

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.800
With the Ideon's power...

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:23.010
Damn it!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.890
There must be a way!

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.300
Careless fools!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:38.170
Gil Bau squad, get away from the Giant!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:44.010
The current has been cut!

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.550
Techno, fire!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.660
Damn you!

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:58.160
Deck!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.190
Hold on!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:00.760
Let's go!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:04.680
What's this?

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:14.780
Did you see that?

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.250
We're retreating.

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:20.550
Provide cover fire!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.490
That Guhaba...

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.160
That's enough!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.860
Call Guhaba.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:35.960
However, that invading samurai...

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:38.320
And the Giant...

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.130
Those aliens are detestable.

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.540
Karala may accept all that, but...

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:46.470
I won't forgive them.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.810
Shall we head back?

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:02.120
I can't return to the Buff Clan anymore.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.050
Both of us are aliens.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.350
We're both aliens to each other.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.970
I know that...

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:38.270
I know...

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:45.080
Cosmo!

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.400
Are you alright?

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:47.370
Yeah!

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:49.700
Deck's doing okay too!

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.410
I'll open the leg hatch!

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:53.170
Thanks.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.130
Karala...

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:58.850
Yes...

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:02.370
Can you live with an alien like me?

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:09.260
Bes...

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:11.430
Bes...

00:22:12.380 --> 00:22:13.690
You're a samurai!

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:52.710
<i>Against the Solo Ship that left the Planet of Ruins,</i>

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:56.180
<i>Guhaba bets his samurai honor on a fierce attack.</i>

00:22:57.220 --> 00:22:59.640
<i>The violent battle on the Solo Ship continues.</i>

00:23:00.660 --> 00:23:04.190
<i>Inside, Karala is targeted by an unknown assailant!</i>

00:23:04.930 --> 00:23:08.720
<i>Who is the one planning to kill Karala?</i>

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.160
<i>Next time, on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Shoot the Alien"</i>

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:17.660
<b>Next Episode</b>

